WEBVTT

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.240
I built Turn of Play.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.410
Watch the match.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:10.780
Check the proof.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:16.610
Here's a recorded goal.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.910
Fan and Analyst views show
different levels of detail

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.840
from the same source.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.040
These matches are synthetic.

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:26.360
The club names are
display labels.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.280
In another tracked example.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.700
The recent line estimate is
about ten metres higher.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.100
Open the proof.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.600
See exactly what supports
that comparison.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:46.620
Forty-one earlier samples.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:49.360
Eighteen recent.

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:52.400
Fifty-nine original observations.

00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:54.470
Independently recomputed.

00:00:56.060 --> 00:01:00.110
You can inspect an original
player position

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.410
right down to its source coordinates.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:05.980
Sometimes, the evidence says wait.

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:09.380
These positions are too old
for a current comparison.

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:14.400
The explanation is withheld
instead of being presented as current.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:21.940
Agent Framework coordinates
the workflow.

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:24.340
The Director routes the incident.

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:26.740
An analyst selects evidence.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.450
A Challenger questions
the interpretation.

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:34.040
Narration and replay follow
separate parts.

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:38.780
Code checks the result against
the source before display.

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:43.520
You're seeing a saved execution,
not live model activity currently.

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:47.020
See what changed.

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:49.390
Understand what supports it.

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:49.820
Know what remains uncertain.

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:52.280
That's Turn of Play.
